message.content:
The products are facial skincare preparations (toner, peel ampoules, serums) put up for retail sale. They fall in heading 3304, which covers beauty or make-up preparations and skin-care preparations. Subheading 3304.99 covers the other preparations, and the 10-digit statistical suffix 3304.99.5000 covers "Other: Other" in the HTSUS, which includes non-medicament skincare preparations.

Subheading 3304.99.50 covers "Other" beauty or skin-care preparations, so the toner, ampoules, and serums all classify there. The 3304.99.50 line carries statistical suffix 00 (3304.99.5000).

